280 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 228 0 R
/E (This is a simplified version of PSG done at home. It typically includes airflow sensors, oxygen saturation, chest and abdominal belts, and sometimes, a position sensor. It is highly effective for diagnosing obstructive sleep apnea but may not capture sleep stages or limb movements [2].)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
